WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.630
First I watched the solar wind from a quiet spot between the Sun and Earth.

2
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:18.180
Then my team swung me past the Moon again and again and sent me through the tail of a comet: the first spacecraft ever to visit one.

3
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:27.720
In 2014, strangers on the internet raised money, borrowed a giant radio dish and talked to me again.

4
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:33.880
In 2014, strangers on the internet woke me up.
